# Crusader of Odric: "Crusader of Odric's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control." (CR 604.3,
# 613.4a.) Bot1 pays exactly {2}{W} with Black Lotus. It counts itself (1/1 alone), then each creature Bot1 controls that
# enters (a Memnite: 2/2, an Ornithopter: 3/3); the power and toughness move together. Bot2's Memnite entering on turn 2 does not
# change it (still 3/3).

